# What the public build must NOT contain.
#
# Most of this is the usual dev clutter, but the first group matters for a
# different reason: RULESET is a mystery, and these files are the answer key.
# tests.html drives every puzzle to its solution, invariants.mjs prints the
# hidden sentence, and docs/ECHO_SPEC.md explains the cipher end to end.
# Shipping them would mean the first curious visitor could read the ending
# before playing the beginning.

tests.html
sea-tests.html
*-tests.mjs
invariants.mjs
docs/
README.md
output/

# Local co-op only: server.mjs is a long-running Node process and live.js is
# injected by it at serve time. Neither has any meaning on static hosting, and
# the single-player game does not depend on them.
server.mjs
live.js

# not needed to serve a static site, and their presence only invites a build
package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
node_modules/

.git/
.gitignore
.impeccable/
.DS_Store
tmp/
_probe.html
